al Answer:**\n**Dengue fever (B) is the most likely diagnosis.** Proceed with confirmatory testing and supportive management as outlined above. If dengue is ruled out, reconsider **Chikungunya** or other arboviruses based on further testing.', tool_calls=Unset(), prefix=False, role='assistant')]
