r vascular repair) during surgery.\n\nThis decision aligns with **ATLS guidelines** and **best practices for managing hemodynamically unstable trauma patients with signs of intra-abdominal hemorrhage**. The patient’s **clinical deterioration and FAST findings** make **exploratory laparotomy the gold standard** for definitive management.', tool_calls=Unset(), prefix=False, role='assistant')]
