- **(C) Glucocorticoids** → **Decrease insulin sensitivity** (e.g., cortisol promotes gluconeogenesis and insulin resistance).
- **(E) TNF-alpha** → **Decreases insulin sensitivity** (pro-inflammatory cytokine linked to obesity-related insulin resistance).
